§§ `The top-level goal`

-- $1,000 payable; $850 paid in money; $100 PAYE (another Act) and $50
-- deducted without consent; action brought the next day.
`a week with an unauthorised deduction` MEANS
    `Wage payment case` OF 1000, (`Payment facts` OF `money`, 850, `a day in 2026`, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE), Date 1 7 2026,
        LIST (`deduct` 100 `on` `a day in 2026` `under` `required or authorised by another Act (s 15)`), (`deduct` 50 `on` `a day in 2026` `under` `no written consent or request`)

#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `total deducted` EQUALS 150
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `lawful deductions` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `unlawful deductions` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `the wages were paid in a lawful manner`
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `the employer contravened ss 4, 5, 5A or 7`
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `recoverable for deductions (s 11(1)(a))` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `recoverable from the employer under s 11` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week with an unauthorised deduction`)'s `wages neither paid nor deducted` EQUALS 0

-- $1,000 payable; $900 lodged to the worker's account without consent; a
-- consented $100 deduction.
`a week paid into the bank without consent` MEANS
    `Wage payment case` OF 1000, (`paid by` `lodgement in the worker's name` `, Crown:` FALSE `, consent:` FALSE `, absent:` FALSE), Date 1 7 2026,
        LIST (`deduct` 100 `on` `a day in 2026` `under` `consent`)

#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week paid into the bank without consent`)'s `lawful deductions` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT NOT (`the wage protection position for` `a week paid into the bank without consent`)'s `the wages were paid in a lawful manner`
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week paid into the bank without consent`)'s `the employer contravened ss 4, 5, 5A or 7`
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week paid into the bank without consent`)'s `recoverable for payment otherwise than in money (s 11(1)(b))` EQUALS 900
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a week paid into the bank without consent`)'s `recoverable from the employer under s 11` EQUALS 900

-- $1,000 payable; $800 paid in money; a consented $100 deduction: $100 is
-- simply unpaid, a matter for the Employment Relations Act, not s 11.
`a short week` MEANS
    `Wage payment case` OF 1000, (`Payment facts` OF `money`, 800, `a day in 2026`, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE), Date 1 7 2026,
        LIST (`deduct` 100 `on` `a day in 2026` `under` `consent`)

#ASSERT NOT (`the wage protection position for` `a short week`)'s `the employer contravened ss 4, 5, 5A or 7`
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a short week`)'s `recoverable from the employer under s 11` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`the wage protection position for` `a short week`)'s `wages neither paid nor deducted` EQUALS 100

§§ `Added after the independent test pass`

-- s 6(2) "recover the amount of that overpayment": $700 deducted for a $500
-- overpayment — $500 lawful, $200 recoverable under s 11(1)(a)(i)
`deducting 700 for the overpayment` MEANS `deduct` 700 `on` (Date 15 7 2025) `under` (`recovery of an overpayment under s 6` `a good overpayment`)
#ASSERT `the lawful part of the deduction` `deducting 700 for the overpayment` EQUALS 500
